.



Administration



Fee waiver. I request a waiver under ORS 192.324(5). Disclosure primarily b=
enefits the general public. These records concern whether correspondence fr=
om a citizen to his Governor was the stated basis for a state police threat=
 assessment, and an intimidating "knock and talk" behind a locked gate on r=
estricted federal land, and how that correspondence was handled by the offi=
ce that received it. I have no commercial purpose. All records produced wil=
l be published in full, at no charge, at oprdvolunteerabuse.org.



Acknowledgment and timeline. ORS 192.324(2) requires acknowledgment or comp=
letion within five business days, and ORS 192.329(5) requires a reasonable =
estimated completion date where a response cannot be completed within fifte=
en business days. I request both in writing.



